 "emails": [
  {
   "subject": "Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund | Pre-IPO & Anchor interest – Sitaram Denims India Limited",
   "text": "Dear Suhas Satardekar,\n\nI am CA Deep Dalal, Fund Manager of Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund. I am writing to you as the Book Running Lead Manager to the proposed IPO of Sitaram Denims India Limited, whose Draft Red Herring Prospectus dated November 3, 2026 has been filed with SEBI for listing on the Main Board of BSE and NSE.\n\nABOUT US\nParshwanath Capital Ventures Fund is a SEBI-registered Category III Alternative Investment Fund focused on India's primary markets. We invest through Pre-IPO placements, IPO Anchor Investor books, the QIB portion of IPOs and Qualified Institutional Placements (QIPs), working closely with promoters and merchant bankers through the listing journey.\n\nOUR VIEW ON SITARAM DENIMS INDIA\nSitaram Denims India is engaged in the manufacture and supply of branded and unbranded woven fabrics, primarily catering to various categories within the apparel segment. We have studied the DRHP closely, and the business and its growth trajectory fit well with our investment focus.\n\nKey financials (restated, ₹ crore unless stated)\n                                    Jun-26*       FY26       FY25       FY24\nRevenue from operations (₹ cr)        75.11     242.38     208.84     111.68\nGrowth (YoY)                              –      16.1%      87.0%          –\nEBITDA (₹ cr)                         15.78      50.48      41.88      20.30\nEBITDA margin                         21.0%      20.8%      20.1%      18.2%\nNet worth (₹ cr)                     121.02     113.06      89.08      73.14\nDebt / Equity                         2.03x      2.01x      2.18x      2.10x\n* Jun-26: interim period, not annualised.\nSource: restated financial information in the DRHP; EBITDA and ratios computed from it.\n\nHOW WE WOULD LIKE TO PARTICIPATE\n  1. Pre-IPO placement: The DRHP contemplates a Pre-IPO Placement. We would be keen to participate in this round.\n  2. Anchor Investor portion: As a SEBI-registered Category III AIF, we qualify as a QIB and would like to be considered for the anchor book.\n  3. QIB portion: We would also look to participate in the QIB portion of the IPO.\n\nI would be grateful if you could introduce us to the promoters of Sitaram Denims India (Anil Kumar Nuwal, Madhu Sudan Nuwal and Jugal Kishore Nuwal) and keep us informed as the pre-IPO and anchor book discussions progress. A short call at your convenience would be much appreciated.\n\nI look forward to hearing from you.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nCA Deep Dalal\nFund Manager, Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund\nSEBI-registered Category III AIF\nEmail: fundmanager@parshwanath.in\nWhatsApp: +91 83200 52970\nPhone / WhatsApp: +91 70690 06298\n\nThis email is for introduction purposes only and does not constitute an offer, solicitation or commitment to invest. Any investment is subject to the Fund's due diligence, investment committee approval and applicable SEBI regulations. To stop receiving emails from us, reply with “unsubscribe”.",
   "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\"><meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"640\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:640px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 14px 4px;border-bottom:3px double #A07A35\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding-right:14px\"><img src=\"cid:pcvf-logo\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" alt=\"Parshwanath Capital Ventures Fund\" style=\"display:block;border:0;border-radius:36px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\"><div style=\"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.6px;color:#A07A35\">PARSHWANATH</div><div style=\"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#A07A35\">CAPITAL VENTURES FUND</div><div style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7B8491;margin-top:5px\">SEBI-registered Category III AIF &middot; Pre-IPO &middot; Anchor &middot; QIB &middot; QIP</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 4px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.4px;color:#7B8491;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5\">Re: <b style=\"color:#A07A35\">Sitaram Denims India Limited</b> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Mainboard IPO &nbsp;|&nbsp; DRHP dated November 3, 2026</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 4px 22px 4px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;\">Dear Suhas Satar